    <string name="s340" formatted="false">"How to use"</string>
    <string name="s341" formatted="false">"Tap the pill to open details; tap outside the panel to close. Hold to open the original app. Swipe left/right for other notifications. Press Close to remove the copy from the island.\n\nOn Tecno, allow background activity if the island stops after the screen turns off. The internet is only used for LRCLIB lyrics lookup when the music panel is opened. Camera, microphone, location, contacts and other permissions are requested automatically when the app opens and are only used by the related feature. The status bar layer mode uses accessibility for drawing only. Turn this layer on so the island is always shown from boot and on the lock screen."</string>
